BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Penn and Teller: 50 Years of Magic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T200000
UID:aee7417132ec404b1d273b0035712cda@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Amazing magic. Tremendous trickery. Hilarious antics. Get read
 y to have your mind blown! Watch as the world's most legendary magicians\,
  Pen and Teller celebrate their milestone anniversary. The celebrated duo 
 will blend classic favourites with astonishing new illusions\, all deliver
 ed with their trademark wit and showmanship for an unforgettable live expe
 rience. David Letterman lauds them as "evil geniuses—always amazing\, al
 ways entertaining\," while The New York Times hails their act as "a wither
 ingly funny\, brazen assault on the temple of magic\," and The Times of Lo
 ndon declares that "the comedy-magic duo are at their absolute peak:.
LOCATION:Meridian Hall\, 1 Front St E\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://www.luminatofestival.com/PennTeller
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Food Halls + Football Food Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260611T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260705T110000
UID:340b7680ba63877b14f0a2418d528b06@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Limited-time\, high-energy\, flavour-packed\, this is Toronto'
 s most delicious ticket of the summer. For one electric month\, Toronto be
 comes a stadium without walls. Showcasing the flavours of football's most 
 passionate nations: Italy\, Argentina\, Mexico\, Venezuela\, Canada and US
 A. Each stop is timed to the rhythm of the tournament. Matches flicker acr
 oss giant screens. Scarves hang from shoulders. Strangers become instant f
 riends over shared allegiances and second helpings. You won't just taste t
 he food. You'll taste the pride behind it. Enjoy tasty food including Arti
 san Sodas and Pretzels\, Crispy Fish Tacos\, Tequeños\, Biscotti and Amar
 etti\, Steak Sandwich with Chimichurri\, Banana Pudding and more!
LOCATION:King St W and Entertainment Districts
URL:https://culinaryadventureco.com/tour/food-halls-football-food-tour
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
